    "updated_at": "2021-05-27T06:13:29Z",
    "body": "Hi @anishkumar127, this is caused by the command starship executes to get the version of node taking too long. If you use the nodejs module you can increase the [command_timeout](https://starship.rs/config/#prompt) by adding the following to the top of your config file. \n```toml \ncommand_timeout = 1000\n```\n\n\nIf you don't use the [nodejs module](https://starship.rs/config/#node-js) you can disable it by adding the following to your config file. \n```toml \n[nodejs]\ndisabled = true \n```",
